WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.843
Toad hurried down the road.

2
00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:07.578
"The sun is shining!" he said.

3
00:00:07.579 --> 00:00:11.158
"I’m happy and carefree!"

4
00:00:11.159 --> 00:00:15.462
Toad danced a little dance.

5
00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:18.861
"Poor Ratty," Toad laughed.

6
00:00:18.862 --> 00:00:23.058
"Badger will be so mad at him!

7
00:00:23.059 --> 00:00:25.271
Rat’s a good friend.

8
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:30.188
But he isn’t as clever as Toad!"

9
00:00:30.189 --> 00:00:34.122
Badger and Mole came back to Toad Hall.

10
00:00:34.123 --> 00:00:37.187
Rat was very upset.

11
00:00:37.188 --> 00:00:40.908
"Rat, what’s wrong?" asked Mole.

12
00:00:40.909 --> 00:00:44.150
"Toad’s gone!" cried Rat.

13
00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:47.030
"I’m so stupid!"

14
00:00:47.031 --> 00:00:50.836
"Toad said he needed a doctor," said Rat.

15
00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:53.221
"He said he was dying."

16
00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:57.181
"Oh Rat," said Badger.

17
00:00:57.182 --> 00:01:00.783
"You fell for that old trick?"

18
00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:04.694
Inside they found the bedroom empty.

19
00:01:04.695 --> 00:01:07.621
"Never mind," said Badger.

20
00:01:07.622 --> 00:01:10.357
"We’ll see him again.

21
00:01:10.358 --> 00:01:13.965
I just hope it’s not in the hospital."

22
00:01:13.966 --> 00:01:18.503
"Or in jail," said Mole.

23
00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:23.015
Down the road, Toad was eating at The Red Lion.

24
00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:28.209
"What a yummy lunch!" said Toad to himself.

25
00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:32.927
Then Toad heard his favorite sound.

26
00:01:32.928 --> 00:01:38.623
Vroom! A big car drove up.

27
00:01:38.624 --> 00:01:41.797
The driver and his friends got out.

28
00:01:41.798 --> 00:01:45.679
Toad watched them come into the restaurant.

29
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:50.588
"They left the car alone," Toad thought happily.

30
00:01:50.589 --> 00:01:55.261
"No one will mind if I look at it."

31
00:01:55.262 --> 00:01:58.243
He walked out to the car.

32
00:01:58.244 --> 00:02:04.464
"Oh my! It’s so beautiful," he gasped.

33
00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:07.366
He looked around carefully.

34
00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:11.587
No one was watching.

